# dex2oat may read priv-app DE profiles and artefacts (AOSP dex2oat.te already allows
# privapp_data_file:file read/write) but AOSP never grants traversal of the directory
# itself. dexopt of com.google.android.gms therefore logs
#   avc: denied { search } for comm="dex2oat" name="com.google.android.gms"
#   tcontext=u:object_r:privapp_data_file:s0 tclass=dir
# and falls back to a profile-less compile. Grant traversal and getattr only; `open`
# is excluded because the AOSP neverallow is checked against the dir class too.
allow dex2oat privapp_data_file:dir { getattr search };
